Pinned Qwen3-0.6B metadata and tokenizer fixtures originate with the Qwen Team,
Alibaba Cloud. Its Apache-2.0 LICENSE and model card are pinned, unchanged,
as test assets.

Pinned Marin-32B metadata and tokenizer fixtures originate with the Marin
community. The retained upstream model card declares Apache-2.0 for code and
model and credits stanford-crfm/marin-tokenizer, whose vocabulary matches Llama 3.
No separate license file is included in that pinned Marin checkpoint. The
original model card and all metadata are pinned, unchanged, as test assets.
Dataset licenses described in that card are separate from this software binding;
no training data or trained model payloads are redistributed here.

Every test asset has a pinned source revision and SHA-256 in tests/fixtures/ports/upstream.json.
